*======================================================================
* common.a99 - code shared by every module of the application, assembled at
* >D000 and mapped there at start-up (app.json "common"): for the test group
* "common".  CADD adds R1 to R0; CMAGIC is a word of data.
*======================================================================
       COPY "kernel.equ"
       COPY "macros.a99"

       AORG >D000
CADD   A    R1,R0
       RT
CMAGIC DATA >C0DE
